+The delimiter is a tab
+MAC               MIMOPS  RSSI0/1/2/3     SNR0/1/2/3   BW(T/R)     MCS(T/R)      SGI(T/R)   Time         MaxBW       MaxMCS   LinkRate(T/R)      MaxLinkRate
+4a:ce:ed:f8:7e:3f 3       -46/-45/-48/--  37/37/35/--  80M/20M     1S-M1/0       0.8us/NA   0000:04:20   160M        2S-M11   1441/1441          2882
+*/
+
